  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Barefoot Bliss on 30A — a brand-new luxury townhome ideally located directly across from Prominence’s zero-entry, resort-style pool, complete with fountains, cabanas, and expansive lounge areas just steps from your door. Perfectly positioned between Seaside and Rosemary Beach and just steps from The Big Chill, this home delivers exceptional walkability, seamless poolside relaxation, and the very best 30A resort living.<br><br>This beautifully designed 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath retreat is fully furnished with all-new décor and curated finishes throughout. Guests enjoy complimentary access to a brand-new, 6-seater street-legal golf cart, making it easy to explore the area without ever needing a car.<br><br>With the resort-style pool just outside your door and the sugar-white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf only minutes away, Barefoot Bliss delivers the perfect balance of relaxation and convenience. The expansive 5,000 sq. ft. pool complex features a zero-entry pool, fountains, cabanas, outdoor kitchens, BBQ stations, and a heated pool during March, April, October, November and Christmas Week. Guests also enjoy access to an additional pool located south of 30A.<br><br>Inside, the home has been thoughtfully updated with a refreshed kitchen, family room, and dining space, all featuring brand-new décor and bedding. The fully stocked kitchen includes upgraded appliances, new pots and pans, cutting boards, a toaster, and a Keurig coffee maker—perfect for cooking and enjoying meals at home.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements: <br>•\tPrimary Suite: King bed with private en-suite bathroom <br>•\tGuest Room: Queen bed with access to shared full bath <br>•\tBunk Room: Custom bunk beds 3 twin beds and 1 full bed with access to shared full bathroom <br><br>Just across the street, The Big Chill delivers nonstop entertainment with a variety of restaurants, bars, boutique shopping, and family-friendly activities. Enjoy concerts, movies, and live sports on the impressive 25-foot outdoor LED screen, plus on-site favorites including a coffee shop, seafood, BBQ, ice cream, and more.<br><br>For beach days and exploring, the garage is stocked with 6 beach chairs, a beach wagon, beach toys, 4 adult bikes, and 2 kids’ bikes, with direct access to the 17-mile paved 30A bike path right outside the community.<br><br>Property Features<br>•\t3 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Sleeps 9<br>•\tLocated in Prominence on 30A between Seaside & Rosemary Beach<br>•\tResort-style community pool<br>•\t6-Seater Golf cart included<br>•\tFree Wi-Fi<br>•\tPack ’n Play & booster seat <br>•\tBoard Games <br>•\tAdult & kids’ bikes<br>•\tWalking distance to dining & entertainment<br>•\tFully equipped kitchen with granite countertops, gas cooktop, built-in oven, full-size refrigerator with ice maker<br>•\tFull-size washer & dryer<br>•\tComfortable porch for dining <br><br>Golf Cart Policy<br>Guests are welcome to use the golf cart. A $300 refundable security deposit and a copy of the driver’s license are required prior to arrival. Drivers must be licensed, follow all local laws, and wear seatbelts at all times.<br><br>Beach Access<br>•\tDeer Lake State Park – approx. 0.4 miles (vehicle & bike parking, restrooms, $3 entry fee)<br>•\tGulf Lakes Public Access – approx. 0.7 miles east (bike parking only)<br>•\tSea Breeze Public Access – approx. 1 mile east (bike parking only)<br>•\tSeacrest Drive Public Access – approx. 1.5 miles east (bike parking only)<br><br>Starter Pack<br>We provide an initial supply of shampoo, conditioner, hand soap, toilet paper, trash liners, paper towels, dish soap, dishwasher pods, sponges, and laundry detergent. Once depleted, guests are responsible for replenishment. A Publix grocery store is located less than 4 miles away.<br><br>Important Notes:<br>•\tGuests must be 21 years or older to book<br>•\tNo pets, no parties, no smoking (inside or on the balcony)<br>•\tMaximum occupancy: 9 guests<br>•\tTwo parking space provided (no street parking, RVs, campers, or trailers)<br>•\tEntry-point security cameras are present for safety<br>•\tRental agreement must be electronically signed<br>•\tCancellation requires 30 days’ notice for a full refund<br>•\tOff-season monthly rates available upon request<br><br>Don't see availability you need? Check out our other properties: Graham and Co Rentals <br><br>Check-In: 4:00 PM<br>Check-Out: 10:00 AM",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
